    },
    {
     "id": 1000399,
     "content_html": "A body starts from rest and accelerates at <span data-math=\"4\\,\\text{m/s}^2\\!\">4\\,\\text{m/s}^2\\!</span> for <span data-math=\"2\\,\\text{s}\">2\\,\\text{s}</span>. The body’s final velocity is <span data-math=\"16\\,\\text{m/s}\">16\\,\\text{m/s}</span>."
